{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the endless world of Steinstern. Explore increasingly large procedural mazes and unlock the doors. Find and upgrade weapons and level-up your ship to stand a chance against the increasingly difficult enemies.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect EXP to upgrade your ship with randomized level-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find weapons in different rarities (used &lt; normal &lt; good &lt; rare &lt; epic &lt; legendary) with special attributes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell or upgrade weapons at the  workshop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers a wide range of difficulties from 'very easy' to 'very hard'</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both keyboard  and mouse or gamepad will work equally well.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in locale coop with dynamic split-screen with two controllers [\ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udfae] on the same PC .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no artifical cap on player, enemy, or weapon levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way through quadrangular and hexangular mazes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/edc4dc9b3b2430b835fb6d67905bf535.avif?t=1771085563\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the\u00a0doors by guessing the right combination:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/18d3e74112f3f1e67c7c0f134aaa2384.poster.avif?t=1771085563\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/18d3e74112f3f1e67c7c0f134aaa2384.webm?t=1771085563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source sr